/target
/site

# Keep .claude/skills/ tracked so they're versioned and shared; ignore everything else
# (worktrees, memory, local settings, session state). model-policy.md is tracked for the same
# reason the skills are — all three of them cite it, so an untracked copy would be a rule that
# only exists on one machine.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills
!.claude/model-policy.md
